  "prefLabel": "Per-A 102.01 Allocation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 102.01 \"Allocation\" means the assignment, by the director of personnel, of a position to a salary grade and class within the classification plan.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Per-A 100) #7377, eff 10-23-00; ss by #9203, eff 10-23-08",
